// Generates tokens of the tiny Qwen3.5 model (`make_tiny_model.py --qwen35`) on the GPU with
// `src/main.vx`, and compares them with `reference.py`. The tokens must be equal, and each logit
// within the tolerance of the reference:
// - the bf16 file, with the bf16 kernels of the experts
// - the Q4_0 file with a 6-bit lm_head, with the Q4_0 kernels
// - the bf16 and the Q4_0 files after a prompt of 2,100 tokens. So the prompt runs in 2 chunks
//   (the state of each layer goes from one chunk to the next), and the full attention layer goes
//   past position 2,048, where its blocks take 64 SIMD groups for each head in place of 32.
// - the Q4_0 file with --draft 7, against the same file without it: the lines of the steps must be
//   the same, logits too. The prompt repeats its first 10 tokens at its end, and the model gives
//   109 and 99 after it, as it did after their first copy, so a round of 7 draft tokens runs.
//
// The products of a chunk round each Q4_0 weight, (code - 8) times its scale, to f16, as for the
// Qwen3 models. So the Q4_0 files get 0.003, as in tests/prefill.vx, and the bf16 files 0.001.
//
// The tiny model has the head sizes of Qwen3.6-35B-A3B (DeltaNet heads of 128, attention heads of
// 256 with RoPE on 64), so it runs the kernels of the real model.
//
// RUN: python3 %S/../scripts/make_tiny_model.py --qwen35 %t.vxw > /dev/null
// RUN: python3 %S/../scripts/reference.py %t.vxw --tokens 1,2,3,4 --steps 16 > %t.reference
// RUN: vxc %S/../src/main.vx --package qwen=%S/../src --host default --machine $VX_FLEET/m4-uma.vx -- %t.vxw --tokens 1,2,3,4 --steps 16 > %t.vx
// RUN: python3 %S/../scripts/compare.py %t.reference %t.vx --tolerance 0.001 | FileCheck %s
// RUN: python3 %S/../scripts/make_tiny_model.py --qwen35 --q4 --q6-lm-head %t-q4.vxw > /dev/null
// RUN: python3 %S/../scripts/reference.py %t-q4.vxw --tokens 1,2,3,4 --steps 16 > %t-q4.reference
// RUN: vxc %S/../src/main.vx --package qwen=%S/../src --host default --machine $VX_FLEET/m4-uma.vx -- %t-q4.vxw --tokens 1,2,3,4 --steps 16 > %t-q4.vx
// RUN: python3 %S/../scripts/compare.py %t-q4.reference %t-q4.vx --tolerance 0.003 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=Q4
// RUN: python3 -c "print(','.join(str(i * 37 % 256) for i in range(2100)))" > %t-long.ids
// RUN: python3 %S/../scripts/make_tiny_model.py --qwen35 --max-positions 2200 %t-long-bf16.vxw > /dev/null
// RUN: python3 %S/../scripts/reference.py %t-long-bf16.vxw --tokens $(cat %t-long.ids) --steps 8 > %t-long-bf16.reference
// RUN: vxc %S/../src/main.vx --package qwen=%S/../src --host default --machine $VX_FLEET/m4-uma.vx -- %t-long-bf16.vxw --tokens $(cat %t-long.ids) --steps 8 > %t-long-bf16.vx
// RUN: python3 %S/../scripts/compare.py %t-long-bf16.reference %t-long-bf16.vx --tolerance 0.001 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LONG-BF16
// RUN: python3 %S/../scripts/make_tiny_model.py --qwen35 --q4 --q6-lm-head --max-positions 2200 %t-long.vxw > /dev/null
// RUN: python3 %S/../scripts/reference.py %t-long.vxw --tokens $(cat %t-long.ids) --steps 8 > %t-long.reference
// RUN: vxc %S/../src/main.vx --package qwen=%S/../src --host default --machine $VX_FLEET/m4-uma.vx -- %t-long.vxw --tokens $(cat %t-long.ids) --steps 8 > %t-long.vx
// RUN: python3 %S/../scripts/compare.py %t-long.reference %t-long.vx --tolerance 0.003 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LONG
// RUN: vxc %S/../src/main.vx --package qwen=%S/../src --host default --machine $VX_FLEET/m4-uma.vx -- %t-q4.vxw --tokens 31,41,59,26,53,58,97,93,23,84,109,99,62,64,33,83,27,31,41,59,26,53,58,97,93,23,84 --steps 32 > %t-plain.vx
// RUN: vxc %S/../src/main.vx --package qwen=%S/../src --host default --machine $VX_FLEET/m4-uma.vx -- %t-q4.vxw --tokens 31,41,59,26,53,58,97,93,23,84,109,99,62,64,33,83,27,31,41,59,26,53,58,97,93,23,84 --steps 32 --draft 7 > %t-draft.vx
// RUN: grep step= %t-plain.vx > %t-plain.steps
// RUN: grep step= %t-draft.vx > %t-draft.steps
// RUN: diff %t-plain.steps %t-draft.steps
// RUN: grep -c step= %t-draft.steps | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=STEPS
// RUN: grep rounds= %t-draft.vx | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=DRAFT
//
// CHECK: 16 steps, same tokens, logits within 0.001
// Q4: 16 steps, same tokens, logits within 0.003
// LONG-BF16: 8 steps, same tokens, logits within 0.001
// LONG: 8 steps, same tokens, logits within 0.003
// STEPS: {{^}}32{{$}}
// DRAFT: rounds=1 drafted=7 accepted=0;
